# SRX400 node 2 (Hub Profile SZTP-SRX400-NODE2, ISP 2): configuration after zero-touch onboarding, display set form.
# Left out: Mist adoption lines (Mist user, outbound SSH, Mist scripts) and box-local lines. Secrets are placeholders.
# Release: Junos OS Evolved 25.4X300-D30.3
# Replace before use: <NODE2-MGMT-IP>, <ROOT-PASSWORD-HASH>, <LICENSE-KEY>, <hub-MAC>, <HUB-WAN-IP> (the hub's WAN
#   address), <NTP-SERVER> (the server Mist renders from pool.ntp.org) and <cloud> (your Mist cloud).
set groups wan
set groups lan
set groups lan-kKLlIL2B
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing profile IOT rule 01 match dynamic-application any
set groups apbr security advance-policy-based-routing profile IOT rule 01 then routing-instance apbr_OrgOverlay
